CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FAlmost three-quarters of England is
OL,7,Fnow in drought, with 45 million people
OL,8,Fliving in affected areas, following a
OL,9,Fdry start to August.
OL,11,FThe National Drought Group has warned
OL,12,Fall regions of the country are
OL,13,Fexperiencing pressure on their water
OL,14,Fresources - with increasing impacts
OL,15,Facross agriculture, public supplies,
OL,16,Fnavigation, and the environment.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FThe East Midlands, Lincolnshire,
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire, Kent, East Sussex,
OL,8,FSolent and the South Downs became the
OL,9,Flatest to move into drought status on
OL,10,FMonday.
OL,12,FThis takes the total to 45 million
OL,13,Fpeople in a drought area - and more
OL,14,Fthan 27 million people are now living
OL,15,Funder restrictions on water use.
OL,17,FThe North East and Yorkshire have
OL,18,Fmoved to prolonged dry weather, the
OL,19,Fstage before drought, with nowhere now
OL,20,Fdeemed in normal status.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FThe changes follow the driest July in
OL,7,F190 years and just 5% of expected
OL,8,Frainfall this month to date.
OL,10,FThere are warnings of more dry weather
OL,11,Fand another heatwave on the way this
OL,12,Fmonth, with temperatures tipped to
OL,13,Freach the mid-30s in some places.
OL,15,FAreas in drought:
OL,17,FWhat is drought?
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FDrought is a long period of little or
OL,7,Fno rain. Every drought is different,
OL,8,Fand they can last from a few weeks to
OL,9,Fseveral years.
OL,11,FIf the UK sees a hot, dry summer, then
OL,12,Fdrought can be quite short and
OL,13,Fintense, but if there are low amounts
OL,14,Fof rainfall over a longer period it
OL,15,Fcan take a while for drought to
OL,16,Fdevelop.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FThe scale of drought is measured based
OL,7,Fon different factors including its
OL,8,Fimpact on agriculture and ecosystems,
OL,9,Fhuman activities and how it affects
OL,10,Fnatural events like wildfires.
OL,12,FDifferent government bodies decide
OL,13,Fwhen an area is facing drought, such
OL,14,Fas the Environment Agency and Natural
OL,15,FResources Wales.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FEnvironment Agency and Chair of the
OL,7,FNational Drought Group, Strategic
OL,8,FDrought Lead Tony Grayling said:
OL,9,F"Drought conditions are worsening and
OL,10,Fwill continue to do so until we see
OL,11,Fsignificant and sustained rainfall.
OL,13,F"We know the hot and dry weather is
OL,14,Ftaking a real toll on farming and
OL,15,Fthere will be long-lasting impacts on
OL,16,Four environment.
OL,26,@qD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,F"We want everyone to stay safe and
OL,7,Fhydrated over the summer, but we need
OL,8,Feveryone's help in using a little less
OL,9,Fwater to make sure our current water
OL,10,Freserves last. Every drop we can save
OL,11,Fis a drop more for your local farmers,
OL,12,Flocal wildlife and local rivers."
OL,14,FWater Minister Emma Hardy has told
OL,15,Fwater companies to do more to cut
OL,16,Fleaks, which increase in the hot
OL,17,Fweather as pipes move in dry soils.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@aO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FSmall steps to reduce water
OL,7,Fconsumption ` such as turning off taps
OL,8,Fwhen brushing teeth or fixing a
OL,9,Fleaking toilet ` can also really add
OL,10,Fup to conserve dwindling supplies
OL,11,Funtil the next period of sustained
OL,12,Frainfall.
OL,14,FDue to the hot weather, many water
OL,15,Fcompanies across the country have
OL,16,Fissued hosepipe bans.
OL,18,FThese weather conditions mean more
OL,19,Fthan 20 million people are currently
OL,20,Fliving under hosepipe bans to help
OL,21,Fprotect drinking water supplies.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G8/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FHosepipes are restricted but watering
OL,7,Fcans and buckets can still be used.
OL,9,FAccording to the Environment Agency,
OL,10,Fusing a hosepipe can require 1,000
OL,11,Flitres an hour ` which is more than a
OL,12,Ffamily-of-four will use in a day.
OL,14,FYour water bill should tell you who
OL,15,Fsupplies your water services, but you
OL,16,Fcan also check the government's
OL,17,Finteractive map. You could only be at
OL,18,Frisk of prosecution if the ban is in
OL,19,Fplace where you live.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G9/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34410
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FWhat does a temporary use ban prevent
OL,7,Fme from doing?
OL,9,FAccording of Ofwat, if you are living
OL,10,Funder a hosepipe ban, you cannot use a
OL,11,Fhosepipe for activities such as
OL,12,Fwatering your garden, filling a
OL,13,Fpaddling pool, or washing your car.
OL,15,FIn many cases, you can still do these
OL,16,Fthings, but will need to use a
OL,17,Fwatering can or bucket instead.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G10/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34411
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FThe rules are laid out under the Water
OL,7,FIndustry Act 1991, although specific
OL,8,Frestrictions vary depending on the
OL,9,Fwater company.
OL,11,FWho enforces a ban, and how much could
OL,12,FI be fined for breaking it?
OL,14,FIn the UK, you could face a fine of up
OL,15,Fto #1,000 for going against the rules,
OL,16,Fwhich are enforced by the water
OL,17,Fcompanies.
OL,19,FMost providers have an online system
OL,20,Fallowing people to report their
OL,21,Fneighbours for breaking restrictions.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G11/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34412
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786477688
OL,3,CAlmost 75% of England now in drought
OL,4,Cafter record dry July
OL,6,FWater companies are investing in ten
OL,7,Fnew reservoirs by 2050 and one of
OL,8,Fthese (Havant Thicket) is currently
OL,9,Funder construction. Combined, these
OL,10,Fwill provide around an additional 700
OL,11,Fmillion litres of water per day.
OL,13,FThe Environment Agency also wants to
OL,14,Fmake it easier to build on-farm
OL,15,Freservoirs and expects to see a more
OL,16,Ffocus on nature-based solutions, such
OL,17,Fas wetland restoration and catchment
OL,18,Fmanagement, to help hold more water
OL,19,Fwhen it rains.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4         G12/12
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
